Every restatement of the helper catalog derives from `renderHelperReferenceMarkdown()`'s output over `packages/agent-skills/src/helper-reference.ts`: sync-helper-reference.mjs splices it verbatim between markers the template must carry and derives the template's suppression ranges from it, the README's enumeration and each platform tree's shipped copy restate it by hand and by render respectively, and nothing compares any of them against the model at build or test time. The script's `--check` mode runs only by hand, so a row added to ROWS or a marker or name edited on one side stays invisible in the shipped reference and the README until someone runs it.
